            "menu": "help-support",
            "text": "<p>If you need urgent help<br/>Settle is not an emergency service. If you or someone you care about is in crisis, please contact:<br/></p><ul><li>Samaritans — 116 123 (free, 24/7)</li><li>NHS 111 — for urgent but non-life-threatening medical advice</li><li>999 — in a life-threatening emergency</li><li>Your GP — for urgent mental health support during working hours</li></ul><p>Your Settle clinician is available for clinical questions about your treatment, but we cannot provide emergency mental health care. Replies to clinical messages aim to be within one working day.</p>"
